      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "人少，不一定工作少。",
      "width": 600,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "影响等待的，不只是人数，还有任务的处理时间。",
      "width": 1320,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
