      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "周围却不断有人交出结果。",
      "width": 720,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "我是不是，慢了？",
      "width": 480,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "原来离开队伍，我还在排队。",
      "width": 780,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
