      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "于是，刚开始又想换一条。",
      "width": 720,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "可是，有些期限真的存在。",
      "width": 720,
      "available": 1680,
      "height": 87,
      "overflow": false,
      "lines": 1
